keywords:
  - research integrity
  - image integrity
  - reproducibility
  - provenance
  - RO-Crate
  - perceptual hashing
abstract: >-
  Fingerprints scientific images (file and pixel SHA-256, difference and
  perceptual hashes in eight orientations) and lists identical and visually
  similar pairs, with a self-contained HTML report and an RO-Crate provenance
  record. A Python tool and an R package implement the same written
  specification and are tested against the same synthetic reference dataset.
